OL,3,GNEWSA'Significant moment' for chough
OL,4,Areintroduction
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservationists are celebrating the
OL,7,Ffledging of eight wild-born red-billed
OL,8,Fchough chicks in Kent.
OL,10,FThe birds were born a year after the
OL,11,Ffirst wild chick to fledge since the
OL,12,Fspecies was reintroduced to the county
OL,13,Fin 2023.
OL,15,FEight captive-reared choughs were
OL,16,Freleased in Dover that year, with the
OL,17,Fcounty's population now thought to be
OL,18,F35 and sightings reported in Thanet and
OL,19,FFolkestone.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
